1. Demonstration Objective
The main objective is to demonstrate that FitBuddy-AI:

Accepts user fitness information.

Uses Gemini to generate a personalized workout plan.

Presents the plan clearly.

Allows users to perform and track workouts.

Stores workout history.

Displays progress.

Handles invalid input and AI/API failures appropriately.

