3. Demonstration Preparation
Before the demonstration:

Start the application.

Confirm the database is running.

Confirm Gemini API configuration works.

Use a prepared test account.

Check that sample data is available.

Verify the main workflow once.

Ensure no API keys or private credentials are visible.

Prepare a backup/demo dataset in case an external service is temporarily unavailable.

